	<marauder_tech name="MarkLevels_FleetShips" display_name="舰队单位等级"
		description="升级所有舰队单位的等级。 Starts at 1, each upgrade add a 25% for the starting mark level of newly spawned ships to be 1 greater than the natural number threshold (i.e. a mark level of 1.25 means that there's a 75% chance for the unit to spawn at mark level 1, and 25% chance of spawning at mark level 2').
